{
  "suite": "lab.config",
  "spec": "0.5.0",
  "description": "Layered experiment-config resolution (design 8.1: defaults, file, environment, CLI, in that order) and the config hash, which is a content hash (spec 4.2) over the resolved config's canonical JSON (spec 4.1). `model` describes the config shape: a member whose value is a string names a scalar type, and a member whose value is an object is a nested config. Env members are read only under the `HEPH_` prefix, with `__` separating nesting levels; CLI options are `--<dotted.path>=<value>`. A scalar from the env or the CLI is read as JSON when it parses as JSON and as a string otherwise. `missing_file` names a file layer whose path does not exist, as against `file`, which supplies one. An absent file layer is reported before any member of any other layer is checked, because a layer that cannot be read at all is a more fundamental failure than a layer that reads and says something wrong. `expect.field` is the dotted path of the member the refusal names.",
  "source": "Hand-derived. The precedence cases are the merge stated by design 8.1 applied to the layers each case supplies; no value in them is computed. The five `expect.hash` cases quote `conformance/hashing/content.json` verbatim: the resolved config of each one canonicalises (spec 4.1) to a document already pinned there, so the digest is taken from that independently sourced vector and not from this kit. empty-config <- `empty-object` ({}); two-integer-members and declaration-order-does-not-change-the-hash <- `key-order-does-not-change-hash` ({\"a\":2,\"b\":1}); non-ascii-string-member <- `non-ascii-string-hashed-as-utf8`; nested-object <- `spec-2.2-fingerprint-example`, whose digest spec 2.2 also states in prose. missing-config-file-is-refused comes from `spec/errors.yaml`, whose HEPH-LAB-422 guidance states that \"a config file that is absent rather than wrong is HEPH-LAB-424\", and from HEPH-LAB-424's own entry, \"Required record, manifest or frozen input is missing\". The four cases from object-replaces-a-scalar-from-an-earlier-layer onward are design 8.1's \"in that order\" carried into three places it does not spell out, each derived as follows and recorded here as a decision rather than read off an implementation. A later layer that supplies an object for a member an earlier layer gave a scalar overrides it like any other member, so the object replaces the scalar. An env or cli member such as HEPH_OPTIM__LR names optim.lr and says nothing about optim itself, so when no layer has supplied an object at optim there is no override to apply and the layer is refused with HEPH-LAB-422 rather than silently granted an object it never named. The command line is read left to right, so a repeated option overrides an earlier one exactly as a later layer overrides an earlier layer. And an absent file layer precedes a bad member in another layer, per the description above.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "defaults-only",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"}
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "file-only",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "file": {"seed": 2, "name": "from-file"}
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 2, "name": "from-file"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "env-only",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "env": {"HEPH_SEED": "3", "HEPH_NAME": "from-env"}
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 3, "name": "from-env"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "cli-only",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "argv": ["--seed=4", "--name=from-cli"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 4, "name": "from-cli"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "file-beats-defaults",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"},
        "file": {"seed": 2}
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 2, "name": "base"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "env-beats-file",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"},
        "file": {"seed": 2, "name": "from-file"},
        "env": {"HEPH_SEED": "3"}
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 3, "name": "from-file"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "cli-beats-env",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"},
        "file": {"seed": 2},
        "env": {"HEPH_SEED": "3"},
        "argv": ["--seed=4"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 4, "name": "base"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "full-precedence-chain",
      "input": {
        "model": {"a": "int", "b": "int", "c": "int", "d": "int", "seed": "int"},
        "defaults": {"a": 1, "b": 1, "c": 1, "d": 1, "seed": 1},
        "file": {"b": 2, "seed": 2},
        "env": {"HEPH_C": "3", "HEPH_SEED": "3"},
        "argv": ["--d=4", "--seed=4"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"a": 1, "b": 2, "c": 3, "d": 4, "seed": 4}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "cli-overrides-one-nested-member",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "optim": {"lr": "float", "momentum": "float"}},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "optim": {"lr": 0.1, "momentum": 0.9}},
        "argv": ["--optim.lr=0.05"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 1, "optim": {"lr": 0.05, "momentum": 0.9}}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "env-overrides-one-nested-member",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "optim": {"lr": "float", "momentum": "float"}},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "optim": {"lr": 0.1, "momentum": 0.9}},
        "env": {"HEPH_OPTIM__MOMENTUM": "0.95"}
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 1, "optim": {"lr": 0.1, "momentum": 0.95}}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "unprefixed-env-members-are-ignored",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"},
        "env": {"PATH": "/usr/bin", "SEED": "99", "HEPH_SEED": "3"}
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 3, "name": "base"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "unknown-cli-key-is-refused",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"},
        "argv": ["--epochs=3"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "HEPH-LAB-422",
        "field": "epochs"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "unknown-nested-cli-key-is-refused",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "optim": {"lr": "float", "momentum": "float"}},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "optim": {"lr": 0.1, "momentum": 0.9}},
        "argv": ["--optim.decay=0.01"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "HEPH-LAB-422",
        "field": "optim.decay"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "unknown-env-key-is-refused",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"},
        "env": {"HEPH_EPOCHS": "3"}
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "HEPH-LAB-422",
        "field": "epochs"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "cli-value-of-the-wrong-type-is-refused",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"},
        "argv": ["--seed=abc"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "HEPH-LAB-422",
        "field": "seed"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "env-value-of-the-wrong-type-is-refused",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "optim": {"lr": "float", "momentum": "float"}},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "optim": {"lr": 0.1, "momentum": 0.9}},
        "env": {"HEPH_OPTIM__LR": "fast"}
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "HEPH-LAB-422",
        "field": "optim.lr"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "missing-config-file-is-refused",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"},
        "missing_file": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "HEPH-LAB-424"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "object-replaces-a-scalar-from-an-earlier-layer",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "optim": {"lr": "float", "momentum": "float"}},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "optim": 1},
        "file": {"optim": {"lr": 0.2, "momentum": 0.8}}
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 1, "optim": {"lr": 0.2, "momentum": 0.8}}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "setting-a-member-of-a-scalar-is-refused",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "optim": {"lr": "float", "momentum": "float"}},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "optim": 1},
        "env": {"HEPH_OPTIM__LR": "0.2"}
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "HEPH-LAB-422",
        "field": "optim.lr"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a-repeated-cli-option-takes-its-last-value",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base"},
        "argv": ["--seed=2", "--seed=3"]
      },
      "expect": {
        "config": {"seed": 3, "name": "base"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a-missing-file-is-reported-before-a-bad-member-elsewhere",
      "input": {
        "model": {"seed": "int", "name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"seed": 1, "name": "base", "epochs": 3},
        "missing_file": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "HEPH-LAB-424"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "config-hash-of-an-empty-config",
      "input": {
        "model": {},
        "defaults": {}
      },
      "expect": {
        "hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "config-hash-of-two-integer-members",
      "input": {
        "model": {"a": "int", "b": "int"},
        "defaults": {"a": 2, "b": 1}
      },
      "expect": {
        "hash": "sha256:d3626ac30a87e6f7a6428233b3c68299976865fa5508e4267c5415c76af7a772"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "declaration-order-does-not-change-the-config-hash",
      "input": {
        "model": {"b": "int", "a": "int"},
        "defaults": {"b": 1, "a": 2}
      },
      "expect": {
        "hash": "sha256:d3626ac30a87e6f7a6428233b3c68299976865fa5508e4267c5415c76af7a772"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "config-hash-of-a-non-ascii-string-member",
      "input": {
        "model": {"name": "str"},
        "defaults": {"name": "Zoë € 😀"}
      },
      "expect": {
        "hash": "sha256:051897ed2926ebd256ec412218e873dbcc11bc4d38debc8a6e49f777dc39db15"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "config-hash-of-a-nested-config",
      "input": {
        "model": {"method": "str", "path": "str", "body": {"b": "int", "a": "int"}},
        "defaults": {"method": "POST", "path": "/v1/charges", "body": {"b": 1, "a": 2}}
      },
      "expect": {
        "hash": "sha256:9d7a9f8a22e4d35d3efc80eafe7f0026713f6ad9ba4a3abd5c025e92036fd6eb"
      }
    }
  ]
}
